--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Parts of this package are ported from two sister packages by the same author, both
under the MIT License:

- geometrics (https://github.com/quarcs-lab/geometrics): the analysis engine in
  src/geo4bolivia/_engine/ (maps, spatial weights, spatial dependence, convergence,
  distribution dynamics, inequality, spatial models, geographically weighted regression)
  and its tests in tests/engine/.
- expdpy (https://github.com/cmg777/expdpy): the design of the exploration functions
  and of the panel models. expdpy is itself a Python port of the R package ExPanDaR
  (https://github.com/joachim-gassen/ExPanDaR, MIT License, Joachim Gassen).
